  "text": "In 2024, the NIIP insured 132,862 DepEd school buildings nationwide, with an approximate insured asset value over PHP 800 billion. The program's operational readiness at a national scale for a large asset class was demonstrated. The GSIS reported a capacity of roughly PHP 843.11 billion for disaster insurance support, indicating significant underwriting capacity for such portfolios.",
